---
layout: landing.njk
title: Overlay Shelf | Ionrift Workshop
description: Download Ionrift overlays and find Patreon module zips. Browser download, then unzip into ionrift-data.
canonical: https://ionrift.cloud/overlay-shelf/
ogTitle: Overlay Shelf
ogDescription: Download overlays for your table. Generative art companions on or off. Patreon links for gated packs and modules.
ogImage: https://ionrift.cloud/img/shelf/header.jpg
bodyClass: page-overlay-shelf
---

{% include "landing/nav.njk" %}

<main class="page-main page-overlay-shelf">
    <div class="container">
        <nav class="page-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>Overlay Shelf</span>
        </nav>

        <header class="shelf-hero-split">
            <div class="shelf-hero-copy">
                <div class="section-label">Downloads</div>
                <h1 class="shelf-hero-title">Overlay Shelf</h1>
                <p class="shelf-hero-lead">
                    Browser download, then unzip into Foundry's Data folder. The list below shows packs available to download now.
                    Connect Patreon to refresh the list for your membership. Nothing on this page installs files from inside Foundry.
                </p>
                <div class="shelf-hero-actions">
                    <div class="shelf-hero-cta">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="download-selected-btn" disabled>
                            Download selected overlays
                        </button>
                        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#install">Where files go</a>
                        <span id="shelf-auth-slot" class="shelf-auth-slot"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="shelf-select-tree" role="group" aria-label="Bulk selection">
                        <label class="shelf-check shelf-check--inline">
                            <input type="checkbox" id="select-all-toggle">
                            <span>Select all</span>
                        </label>
                        <label class="shelf-check shelf-check--child" id="select-all-generative-label">
                            <input type="checkbox" id="select-all-generative-toggle">
                            <span>Include generative art &amp; audio</span>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="shelf-note shelf-hero-hint" id="download-selected-hint">
                    Select one or more packs, then Download selected, or use Download on a single tile.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="shelf-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src="/img/shelf/header.jpg" alt="" width="720" height="405" decoding="async">
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="shelf-section shelf-section--tight" aria-labelledby="shelf-packs-heading">
            <div class="shelf-section-head">
                <h2 id="shelf-packs-heading" class="shelf-h2">Overlays</h2>
                <p class="shelf-note">
                    Download a pack now, or select several and use Download selected.
                    Packs that need a higher membership sit under Other overlays.
                </p>
                <p class="shelf-note shelf-note--disclosure">
                    Select all picks every data pack. Use the nested option for generative art and audio, or tick tiles one by one.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div id="shelf-overlays" aria-live="polite">
                <p class="shelf-loading">Loading pack list...</p>
            </div>
        </section>

                <section class="shelf-section" id="install" aria-labelledby="install-heading">
            <h2 id="install-heading" class="shelf-h2">Where <code>ionrift-data</code> lives</h2>
            <p class="shelf-note">
                Foundry's <strong>Data</strong> folder is the root. Create <code>ionrift-data</code> next to <code>modules</code> and <code>worlds</code> if it is not there yet.
                Cached overlay bundles unzip at Data root and create that tree. Per-pack zips still go into each subfolder so <code>overlay-manifest.json</code> lands correctly. Then reload the world.
            </p>

            <div class="shelf-fs-grid">
                <figure class="shelf-fs-panel">
                    <figcaption>Before</figcaption>
                    <pre class="shelf-fs-tree" aria-label="Data folder before overlays">Data/
|-- modules/
|-- systems/
|-- worlds/
|-- (no ionrift-data yet)</pre>
                </figure>
                <figure class="shelf-fs-panel shelf-fs-panel--after">
                    <figcaption>After (example)</figcaption>
                    <pre class="shelf-fs-tree" aria-label="Data folder after overlays">Data/
|-- modules/
|-- systems/
|-- worlds/
|-- ionrift-data/
    |-- overlays/
        |-- ionrift-respite/
        |   |-- core/
        |   |   |-- overlay-manifest.json
        |   |-- cooking/
        |       |-- overlay-manifest.json
        |-- ionrift-quartermaster/
            |-- core/
                |-- overlay-manifest.json</pre>
                </figure>
            </div>

            <ul class="shelf-host-notes">
                <li><strong>Self-hosted:</strong> open the Foundry User Data path from Setup, or your host's file browser for that volume.</li>
                <li><strong>Hosted Foundry:</strong> use the host's asset / file manager and place the same folder tree under Data.</li>
                <li><strong>Download selected:</strong> downloads the chosen overlays for extract under Data. Module zips stay separate.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="shelf-card shelf-card--confirm" id="shelf-confirm" aria-labelledby="shelf-confirm-heading">
            <img class="shelf-card-icon" src="/img/shelf/icon-confirm.svg" alt="" width="40" height="40">
            <div class="shelf-card-body">
                <h2 id="shelf-confirm-heading" class="shelf-card-title">Confirm</h2>
                <p class="shelf-note">
                    Paste this Script macro into Foundry and run it to verify overlays on disk
                    (latest / outdated / missing). Macro v{{ overlayStatusMacro.version }}.
                </p>
                <details class="shelf-macro-details">
                    <summary>Show status macro</summary>
                    <pre class="shelf-macro" id="shelf-macro-display" hidden><code></code></pre>
                </details>
                <script type="text/plain" id="shelf-macro-source">{{ overlayStatusMacro.text | safe }}</script>
            </div>
            <div class="shelf-card-action">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="copy-macro-btn">Copy macro</button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="shelf-card shelf-card--modules" aria-labelledby="modules-strip-heading">
            <img class="shelf-card-icon" src="/img/shelf/icon-modules.svg" alt="" width="40" height="40">
            <div class="shelf-card-body">
                <h2 id="modules-strip-heading" class="shelf-card-title">Foundry modules by Ionrift Workshop</h2>
                <p class="shelf-note">
                    Cursewright and Monstrous Feast are module zips. Install through Foundry Add-on Modules.
                    They are not part of an overlays zip. Support development on Patreon.
                </p>
                <div id="shelf-modules" class="shelf-module-links" aria-live="polite">
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="{{ site.patreonUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Patreon modules</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="shelf-card-action">
                <a class="shelf-patreon-chip" href="{{ site.patreonUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                    <svg class="shelf-patreon-chip-logo" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.386.524c-4.764 0-8.64 3.876-8.64 8.64 0 4.75 3.876 8.613 8.64 8.613 4.75 0 8.614-3.864 8.614-8.613C24 4.4 20.136.524 15.386.524zM.003 23.537h4.22V.524H.003z"/></svg>
                    <span>patreon.com/Ionrift</span>
                    <svg class="shelf-patreon-chip-ext" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4h6v6"/><path d="M10 14L20 4"/><path d="M20 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5"/></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <p class="page-back">
            <a href="/overlays/">&larr; Overlay catalogue</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</main>

{% include "landing/footer.njk" %}

<script type="application/json" id="shelf-art-map">{{ overlayShelfArt | jsonEncode | safe }}</script>
<script type="application/json" id="shelf-module-map">{{ overlayShelfModules | jsonEncode | safe }}</script>
<script type="module" src="/js/overlay-shelf.js"></script>
